[75s] phase=Paused    step=3 ar=rollouts-demo-58d7456779-8 Running
[90s] phase=Degraded  step=0 ar=rollouts-demo-58d7456779-8 Failed   -> ABORTED

--- AnalysisRun detail (rollouts-demo-58d7456779-8) ---
phase: Failed
metric=agent-verdict phase=Failed failed=2 successful=None count=2
measurements:
  value="unknown" phase=Failed finishedAt=2026-07-25T17:27:16Z
  value="unknown" phase=Failed finishedAt=2026-07-25T17:28:16Z

  The measured value is literally the verdict string, extracted by
  `jsonPath: "{$.verdict}"` from a 200 response. Not an HTTP error, not a
  timeout -- the agent said "I don't know" and the release stopped.

